# NOTE: the whole data/ directory is currently untracked, which includes
# data/corpus (the retrieval corpus), data/models (the ONNX encoder) and
# data/chroma_db (the prebuilt vector index).
#
# A deployment built from this repository therefore has no corpus and no index.
# The retriever logs "Retriever unavailable; audits will use a fixed passage" and
# every finding falls back to one hardcoded sentence. Re-add the subset the app
# needs (corpus JSON + ONNX model + chroma_db) before deploying for retrieval to
# work, or fetch it during the build.


